Template: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/max9x
Type: select
Choices: @marchlist@
Default: @marchdefault@
Description: Select  GMSL2 Serializer-Deserializer ACPI type [defaut:@marchdefault@]
 probe GMSL2 kernel drivers on Camera ACPI device either for @marchlist@.

Template: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/acpi-ssdt-camera
Type: select
Choices: @pdatalist@
Default: @pdatadefault@
Description: Select ACPI Camera Platform Data (PDATA) type [defaut:@pdatadefault@]
 with compile options either for @pdatalist@.

Template: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/ipu
Type: select
Choices: @ipulist@
Default: @defaultipu@
Description: Select Intel IPU [defaut:@defaultipu@] SSDT-overlays.

Template: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/board
Type: select
Choices: ${boardlist}
Default: @defaultmaximserdes@
Description: Select ${ipuextended}-to-deserializer [defaut:@defaultmaximserdes@] ACPI devices SSDT-overlays.

Template: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/sensor
Type: select
Choices: ${sensorlist}
Default: @defaultsensor@
Description: Select ${boardextended}-to-sensor [defaut:@defaultsensor@] ACPI devices SSDT-overlays.

Template: intel-mipi-gmsl-dkms/d4xx-compat
Type: select
Choices: @d4xxdeserlist@
Default: @defauld4xxserdes@
Description: Compile d4xx-compat (legacy <= 1.0.1.31) GMSL2 Serializer-Deserializer [defaut:@defauld4xxserdes@]
  ACPI PDATA probe GMSL2 kernel drivers on Camera ACPI device either for @d4xxdeserlist@.


